 "description": "Synthetic kiln chamber kiln-k3 (invented). Temperature measured by two system thermocouples (t1, t2, possibly compatible), by an external lab lab-veld (t3, unreviewed by the system, accepted by nobody but lab-veld, which also accepts t1), and later by the system again (t4, recorded after mark before-t4, disjoint from t1 and t2). A stated (not measured) value s1 is given in degrees Fahrenheit. Two certificates: cert-ta matches t1's stated reference; cert-tb's reference differs from t2's stated reference. Also defines mass units for conversion questions. All times are valid times (T<d> = 2026-11-<d> 09:00 UTC).",
